anned swing music from the US. Soon dancing and fun leads to more difficult choices as the Nazis begin tightening the grip on Germany. Each member of the group is forced to face some tough choices about right, wrong, and survival.","tagline":"In a world on the brink of war. You either march to one tune or dance to another."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hTGBWMjOn4QTRta0MOHe6iyggwb.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1nJozcSOKcSqjN46hMU1xnWJRZ4.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"enrichment":{"status":"ready","hasMissingEpisodeMetadata":false}}
